            <div xml:id="m-0848e14a-3fbc-42d5-8909-a702525e7e51">
              <lg xml:id="m-7069bbaa-d6b6-485e-bab0-57695fd084af">
                <l xml:id="m-e6638ac6-05d4-4a97-b41f-8b8fa1696174" facs="#m-3132bfd5-d01f-457c-b570-ec80a0b11266" label="text-like">Common of a Martyr-Bishop. Mass I.</l><l xml:id="m-87645136-4eec-4dbc-9993-b9049b7d0b02" facs="#m-51fdedc8-b50f-4a5b-a4a5-021ac56b9312" label="ambiguous">1129</l><l xml:id="m-5efea89b-c56a-4841-9523-03ef50a3be2f" facs="#m-66a23cc8-05c3-42c1-91fe-d78f0009254c" label="text-like">For a Martyr-Bishop. Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-085fa5a7-d952-485a-be43-3a5d5741576a" facs="#m-aa26fdf6-1d6d-4415-9e30-903a2990aba5" label="lyrics-like">TNfirmitátem nostram réspice, l beáti N. Mártyris tui atque Ponti¬</l><l xml:id="m-baedaf8e-1323-454c-8472-d964496a130b" facs="#m-0233ed7f-5451-4538-b0d6-5b9b84c1ccbe" label="lyrics-like">L omnípotens Deus: t et quia</l><l xml:id="m-905470cc-2b9f-4e06-9d04-0ce5dbaac9a4" facs="#m-85c99717-efd7-47b0-be4e-7e1433292ff3" label="lyrics-like">ficis intercéssio gloriósa nos próte¬</l><l xml:id="m-f0f72c40-b984-42da-b6be-a40a51a6d906" facs="#m-0d80ce4f-5969-403b-91c8-28218461adc4" label="lyrics-like">pondus própriae actiónis gravat,"</l><l xml:id="m-57396443-e4fe-460a-9d10-b0bddba06a1a" facs="#m-a93114c7-e5e2-4a6b-924d-18a893146cb1" label="lyrics-like">gat. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-56915b9d-eaa2-486b-9a85-62a2c3cb56b1" facs="#m-cd70e81a-21d9-45b3-81df-0ee44042b150" label="text-like">Another Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-de1b283e-0f28-4f74-98e3-130c311c74de" facs="#m-3d78a19c-60dc-4cd6-b9d4-7d19155abd82" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nos beáti N. Mártyris pitius; ut cujus natalitia cólimus,</l><l xml:id="m-cb685799-8a6d-484f-b731-833acaf12d05" facs="#m-a5da4ae9-2c6a-4bb5-95e0-f5f3f9327996" label="lyrics-like">Utui atque Pontificis ánnua so¬</l><l xml:id="m-193649c5-0448-452c-a80f-5e6e2323f5a5" facs="#m-8532fef5-f781-4d8b-abd8-bbd0fac6b007" label="lyrics-like">de ejúsdem étiam protectióne gau¬</l><l xml:id="m-b54be567-623e-43b3-9515-af958d33aca5" facs="#m-7e955242-a27a-495d-a7de-2fb0805948d2" label="lyrics-like">lemnitáte laetíficas:t concéde pro- deámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-33702d77-9d1e-4f61-994a-fd1a7d96d4bb" facs="#m-71189d36-bff6-4e20-b1b9-29685318639e" label="text-like">For a Martyr not a Bishop. Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-c6bf5232-3b34-4518-9fc5-c1b420e7431a" facs="#m-4d95692e-f207-4911-ae68-aab8367ef99a" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus omnípotens cessióne ejus in tui nóminis amóre</l><l xml:id="m-b170f24c-11ae-406e-81b6-91994f9e7025" facs="#m-7968bed7-7991-44eb-a51c-75c7e98b1d1a" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: f ut qui beáti N. Már¬</l><l xml:id="m-0745efbc-60b5-45c9-8627-d07e4166e424" facs="#m-cad71da3-c1db-487a-8601-2f9d4f94a8ad" label="lyrics-like">roborémur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-8ec5722e-494c-4dd5-ad08-a3b7f678c098" facs="#m-3e3ac811-9e7d-4bde-b519-d716379be110" label="lyrics-like">tyris tui natalitia cólimus, “inter¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7d92695-28b1-464b-8da2-ba512f791722" facs="#m-77372038-9b54-4507-a14c-527860bcc79b" label="text-like">Another Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-43dd21d6-66ed-4073-aff8-98b5443252db" facs="#m-aced29d0-20b5-4e57-a9bb-4f718654177f" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus omnípotens sitátibus liberémur in córpore, “ et</l><l xml:id="m-12fc7199-23c1-46ea-8d46-410bd191a8f8" facs="#m-3e1efd15-2ee8-4eea-a79c-c84fbbf664f0" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: t ut intercedénte beáto! a pravis cogitatiónibus mundémur</l><l xml:id="m-af32e3f7-4d38-4193-b94f-f0ee3964de9d" facs="#m-8fc621ce-5cfe-45f5-b7c3-60152b44af29" label="lyrics-like">N. Mártyre tuo, et a cunctis adver-lin mente. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-258584c9-295b-447d-bea0-419588fe91ee" facs="#m-fe8b244b-3a84-4342-909c-40ecc04191ce" label="text-like">If a Commemoration be made of another Martyr who has not an</l><l xml:id="m-fcda3c67-8aee-41fd-be90-ff1c2289dbcb" facs="#m-81d80806-bb63-45d5-9fc1-a567ffe7f033" label="text-like">Antiphon proper to his feast, the following Antiphon is said:</l><l xml:id="m-3d754b22-491d-41a7-b574-ffd31223becd" facs="#m-53c0fae7-815d-4ab7-94e8-ccdf5adf28c6" label="ambiguous">Ant. 4</l><l xml:id="m-cf71e26e-a6f9-41d3-9742-f9332b9715a7" facs="#m-9934abce-c313-432e-9b85-b167a0c402af" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-14ec610a-3342-4cd5-94f3-188a67c25de8" facs="#m-16f16dbd-f921-4978-8620-85b62ff903eb" label="lyrics-like">UI ó- dit “ ánimam sú-am in hoc múndo.</l><l xml:id="m-82b6af65-9f2b-4a47-8494-0e4ddee459b3" facs="#m-b4194ca2-a22c-4f8b-8643-a5b8a3d0d297" label="ambiguous">in vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-d77e2315-1dba-485e-9c9d-8518148db012" facs="#m-4bf8d901-6c1e-4818-ade8-73bad669b491" label="lyrics-like">tam aetérnam custó-dit é¬ am.</l><l xml:id="m-fed255b6-7732-4bc0-ac40-19d318402c3c" facs="#m-58ca8cde-a520-495d-b686-3dc005d67908" label="lyrics-like">V. Jústus ut pálma, p. 1128. untess it hos atready been said, in which</l><l xml:id="m-d8fd5f68-0eaf-43d6-98a1-0c2b2a3af28e" facs="#m-f6c93319-b53d-4941-afa0-8144d905813b" label="text-like">case the following V. is used instead.</l><l xml:id="m-3deafb0a-069b-4f1e-bf9d-b52212c74425" facs="#m-d3bff07a-62f7-4b03-9cf1-caa5a05e0f15" label="lyrics-like">V. Posuisti Dómine super cáput éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-467bd064-3ae1-4126-8f2c-6805554635b0" facs="#m-580e073d-0938-483b-a5db-c5c1b9eca03c" label="lyrics-like">R. Corónam de lápide pretióso.</l><l xml:id="m-e5db6e93-6fb0-455e-a616-7643f2c9524a" facs="#m-4ddc367d-13db-425d-bc85-a995072b9967" label="text-like">Compline of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-d3719b25-41ae-42e6-88e5-11cd3513a615" facs="#m-5fc44c36-30aa-42d3-83e7-a3de56bd73d0" label="text-like">I. MASS OF A MARTYR-BISHOP.</l><l xml:id="m-2818f9e2-3720-40d8-864f-fcbec611e50b" facs="#m-99dd7c88-4e54-488f-a6c7-ad4e28ede0e8" label="lyrics-like">Introit. Státuit. p. 1182.</l><l xml:id="m-a8334fd4-420b-457d-a13d-51b62e560011" facs="#m-c2f8ea81-f293-41bf-a307-03685e00a5a4" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-8774951c-c2ca-498f-897c-c977ddc053d4" facs="#m-0e09fe4d-81b3-4d66-bed5-af8592b46d38" label="lyrics-like">TNfirmitátem nostram réspice, lbeáti N. Mártyris tui atque Ponti¬</l><l xml:id="m-68733e37-a653-4214-96ed-e62fdd086b40" facs="#m-efee6735-dfcf-4c53-85fc-47028837a994" label="lyrics-like">L omnípotens Deus: t et quia ficis intercéssiõ gloriósa nos próte¬</l><l xml:id="m-c616fca2-3edb-4b79-b10c-e6cbd0f14f2c" facs="#m-a9f7cc53-ae87-4bf0-8ca7-b0e743e1d661" label="lyrics-like">pondus própriae actiónis gravat, *gat. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2c6f8ef2-9e18-4ef7-8413-e85800e746e8" facs="#m-f181c6d7-94a7-4f67-9121-5f1960e86a9e" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Jacobi Apostoli Jac. T. b.</l><l xml:id="m-aa61bde7-a442-45ee-8243-8ef6b0b0e0c9" facs="#m-1b46c929-8e4b-42a1-9eb0-9772be55e66e" label="lyrics-like">(VArissimi : Beátus vir, qui suffert! Deus enim intentátor malórum est:</l><l xml:id="m-2a4207fc-b853-43fa-a951-2740f4c1a785" facs="#m-bb24563b-b54e-4a09-9886-58722324b7d3" label="lyrics-like"> tentatiónem: quóniam cumlipse autem néminem tentat. Unus¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c19edf0-97df-4a9c-ab7e-0be74c596a8c" facs="#m-78797f76-3f20-4d52-8438-a3c14701e625" label="lyrics-like">probátus fúerit, accspiet corónam quisque vero tentátur a concupi¬</l><l xml:id="m-d15ee079-a65d-47bf-b764-b5bdc62b9ab3" facs="#m-e915f4a7-8a11-4047-a35c-dca7a581caeb" label="lyrics-like">scéntia sua abstráctus, et illéctus.</l><l xml:id="m-59eeda83-9557-4a0b-a0d7-962fd187016d" facs="#m-a7185b74-1a86-44da-b34e-803437244508" label="lyrics-like">vitae, quam repromísit Deus dili¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b57d37f-f3ad-4078-bb30-c5fc637ade5a" facs="#m-282aade0-1ae6-404e-8caa-f241fa1693b3" label="lyrics-like">Deínde concupiscéntia cum concé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d9f092e-93e1-4f6f-aa60-4b43563e5dae" facs="#m-3df7572f-742d-4a68-834f-2f3c15e6ed31" label="lyrics-like">géntibus se. Nemo cum tentátur,</l><l xml:id="m-f663a107-6aa2-4b0f-8f51-6b75e1aa574c" facs="#m-f9c72730-814c-4a6a-ad5e-8bada7f1fb5c" label="lyrics-like">dicat quóniam a Deo tentátur: perit, parit peccátum: peccátum</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>